{"role":"tool","content":"    1\t{\"meta\":true,\"id\":\"20260916-112348h4cc\",\"cwd\":\"D:\\\\GoatCode-ts\\\\gaia\",\"model\":\"freellmapi/auto\",\"title\":\"subagent: Research ScienceDirect data\",\"createdAt\":1789538028.923,\"compactedFrom\":47,\"usage\":{\"in\":659173,\"out\":3190,\"cacheRead\":0,\"cacheWrite\":0},\"digest\":\"\",\"turnMarks\":[]}\n    2\t{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"I need you to use websearch and webfetch to find data about the number of \\\"Reference Works\\\" on ScienceDirect for Life Sciences domains vs Health Sciences as of 2022.\\n\\nTry these searches:\\n1. websearch: \\\"ScienceDirect Reference Works count life sciences health sciences\\\"\\n2. websearch: \\\"ScienceDirect subject areas statistics 2022 reference works\\\"\\n3. Try visiting https://www.sciencedirect.com/topics via webfetch\\n4. Try visiting https://www.sciencedirect.com/browse via webfetch\\n\\nIf websearch/webfetch fail, try using bash to curl the pages. Try commands like:\\ncurl -s \\\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/topics\\\" \\ncurl -s \\\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/browse/subjects\\\"\\n\\nReturn ALL the numbers you find. I specifically need:\\n- How many journals/books are classified as \\\"Reference Works\\\" in each Life Science domain\\n- How many journals/books are classified as \\\"Reference Works\\\" in Health Sciences\\n\\nThis data would be on the ScienceDirect website itself, probably on a page listing subject areas with counts.\"}\n    3\t{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"I'll start by running all the searches and fetches in parallel to gather as much data as possible.\\n\",\"toolCalls\":[{\"id\":\"call_64d5d314924b4e9d9c7f681e\",\"name\":\"websearch\",\"arguments\":{\"query\":\"ScienceDirect Reference Works count life sciences health sciences\",\"max_results\":10}},{\"id\":\"call_ad715342b4de4b0385c59ad7\",\"name\":\"websearch\",\"arguments\":{\"query\":\"ScienceDirect subject areas statistics 2022 reference works\",\"max_results\":10}},{\"id\":\"call_6e0d9614ee2c46e78c465086\",\"name\":\"webfetch\",\"arguments\":{\"prompt\":\"Find the number of Reference Works listed for Life Sciences and Health Sciences subject areas. Look for any counts or numbers associated with subject categories.\",\"url\":\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/topics\"}},{\"id\":\"call_a7ae24142ab944c3b6f99024\",\"name\":\"webfetch\",\"arguments\":{\"prompt\":\"Find the number of Reference Works listed for Life Sciences and Health Sciences subject areas. Look for any counts or numbers associated with subject categories, especially \\\"Reference Works\\\" classification.\",\"url\":\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/browse\"}}]}\n    4\t{\"role\":\"tool\",\"content\":\"permission required but no prompt available for websearch\",\"toolCallId\":\"call_64d5d314924b4e9d9c7f681e\",\"name\":\"websearch\"}\n    5\t{\"role\":\"tool\",\"content\":\"permission required but no prompt available for websearch\",\"toolCallId\":\"call_ad715342b4de4b0385c59ad7\",\"name\":\"websearch\"}\n... [62 more lines]","toolCallId":"call_7cd50a58aca84b80ad6f2560","name":"read"}
